---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Core Values: Find & Prioritize | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Core values: choose and narrow what truly matters, reflect on priorities, and build self-awareness with guidance from Tangible Mental Health. Contact us today!!"}>
<section class="sec t-white h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:20;--mrows:22">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/9/8/19;--m:3/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1><span class="c-darkAccent">Values</span></h1></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/9/21/19;--m:7/2/23/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><p class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent"><strong><em>Below is a list of commonly used core values. This list is not exhaustive, but it will give you an idea of some common core values. My recommendation is to select ten core values, then narrow it down to five—if everything is a core value, then nothing is really a priority.</em></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent"><strong><em>Questions to help narrow down your values</em></strong></span></p><p>Think about the things that you find meaningful. What do you think of?</p><p>The last time you really enjoyed yourself, what were you doing?</p><p>If your friends or family were asked to describe you, what would you hope they would say?</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:31;--mrows:83">
  <div class="b b-embed" style="--d:1/10/19/18;--m:2/2/84/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div>
<iframe frameborder="0" height="2838" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScc_gLl4uK5k71xiAD7keCsIncB_1NwVyoG0FS2JWQgxBYGfA/viewform?embedded=true" width="400">Loading…</iframe>
</div>
<style is:inline class="transform-overrides-vars">
</style></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
